            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Have you tried using 'langmap' instead of key mapping? It seems like a more appropriate solution for your use case.\r\n\r\nSo instead `vim.keymap.set(\"\", \"k\", \"i\")` try `vim.o.langmap = 'k;i,i;k'` and use default `config.inside`. I can reproduce it working as expected for Visual mode for me.",
